  "content": "\n\n<h2>与 Bisect 的合作</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbh.lesbian.skin%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/55cc5ca9-2d63-4944-b6ff-d5b216f96ca9.webp\" alt=\"bisect hosting\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/incendium-biomes-only\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fibo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fnaomieow%252fibo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/gitlab_vector.svg\" alt=\"gitlab\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnaomieow\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-singular\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fdiscord.naomieow.xyz%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-singular\"></a></p>\n<p>这个小型数据包在<em>不</em>重新分发任何代码的情况下，移除了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fincendium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Incendium</a> 数据包/模组中的所有物品、生物、首领和结构。该需求在 Stardust Labs 的 Discord 服务器中十分常见，因此我决定制作此包以平息一些争议。</p>\n<h3>本人并非 Stardust Labs 成员，Stardust Labs 也绝不会为此提供任何支持。如需获取此数据包的支持，请使用 GitHub Issue 追踪器或加入我的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KyBzvxwgvw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></h3>",
